From 5ad4dc982498a2e0ba2245ef3c84c4fd661c0c43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:02:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] hexagonrpcd: support writing files in a writable persist
 directory

Implement the fwrite, fsync, fremove, ftrunc and frename methods of
apps_std and open files for writing in fopen_with_env.

Add the -w option to serve a writable directory as
/mnt/vendor/persist/sensors/registry. The sensor DSP of some devices
(e.g. the OnePlus 8 Pro) keeps trying to write registry groups to it and
does not bring up all sensors when this fails.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
